      "tactic_notes": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Nicholas(60)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【General Store owner/Former Soldier】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The owner of the \"Nick\" knack shack. He is a jovial old man who the villager regarded as uncle.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Kind Uncle</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Nicholas is often regarded as the uncle of the village because of his kind and friendly demeanor. Especially to the children of the village, which they affectionately call him \"Uncle Nick\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Traveling Trader</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">As the merchant of the village, Nicholas often have the opportunity to travel outside the village to procure materials and supply for the village</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Gifts for the young</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">On his travels, he would not forget to bring back handpicked gifts for everybody in the village, which they enjoy, especially the children.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Former Soldier</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>​​​​​​​</strong>Like the Blacksmith Grigoriy, he is a former soldier serving under the empire, but he retire due to wanting a more comfortable and quiet life as he gets older.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Chain Smoker</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">​​​​​​​Nicholas smoke a lot with his pipe</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Chicken Pot Pie:</strong> This hearty dish encompasses tender chicken, vegetables, and savory gravy encased in a flaky, buttery crust</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【View on Magic】</strong></p>\n<p>As a former soldier, Nicholas strongly dislike Magic, as he has experience the receiving sides of it in the war.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Greeting Travelers, I'm Nicholas, the owner of the Nick knack shack, get it? Nick and my name Nicholas. hahaha\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Used to be a soldier in my younger days, but I'm getting old now, so I wanted a more quieter life, what better than to settle in this rural village huh?\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"My job as the merchant is to secure outside goods for this village, This place is a bit far from the capital, but I make sure everybody has what they want.\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Come look around, it's nothing fancy, but it'll work, haha, if there's anything more you need, feel free to ask.\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>",
